\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. SUMMER suns are glowing
\par Over land and sea;
\par Happy light is flowing,
\par Bountiful and free.
\par Everything rejoices
\par In the mellow rays;
\par All earth's thousand voices
\par Swell the psalm of praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. God's free mercy streameth
\par Over all the world,
\par And His banner gleameth,
\par Everywhere unfurled.
\par Broad, and deep, and glorious,
\par As the heaven above,
\par Shines in might victorious
\par His eternal love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord upon our blindness
\par Thy pure radiance pour;
\par For Thy loving-kindness
\par Make us love Thee more.
\par And when clouds are drifting
\par Dark across our sky,
\par Then, the veil uplifting,
\par Father, be Thou nigh.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. We will never doubt Thee,
\par Though Thou veil Thy light;
\par Life is dark without Thee,
\par Death with Thee is bright.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Light of light, shine o'er us
\par On our pilgrim way;
\par Go Thou still before us
\par To the endless day.
\par AMEN.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

